class_name HubArt
## What the hubs grow as their post roads fill (PIX-324, Hubs): Saltmere's
## lighthouse on the point, mended, glazed in sea glass and lit; the trestle
## and then the stall at Blackiron's camp; Mabel's tent at Greyhold and the
## market's stalls round it; Gunnar's lodge at the Frostgate, its frame, its
## walls and its fire. Drawn in code in Shade's palette (HamletArt.INKS, with
## the sea glass's two greens), at 1x on his 16 px grid: our own, so CC0, the
## same with or without the paid pack. HamletArt draws them as it draws its
## own pieces (a piece's foot is its bottom row); a lit one's flame and sea
## glass burn at night (HamletArt.shine).
## Made with a small drawing script (lines, tapers, an outline round what's
## drawn), so edit the rows by hand as any other piece's.

